Using the cosine rule in the triangle with sides $37$ and $43$ and included angle $138^\circ$:
$$\begin{aligned} x &= \sqrt{37^2+43^2-2\times 37\times 43\times\cos 138^\circ} \\ &= 74.72 \text{ m} \end{aligned}$$

